#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:1
msgid "Isolate plugin classpath"
msgstr "プラグイン・クラスパスの隔離"

#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:4
msgid ""
"```admonish note\n"
"The recipe section of the documentation focuses on the objectives\n"
"with minimal explanations about the basics.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```admonish note\n"
"このドキュメントのレシピ・セクションは、基礎についての説明を最小限にとどめ、目標に焦点を当てている。\n"
"```"

#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:9
msgid "Objective"
msgstr "目標"

#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:12
msgid ""
"I want to isolate plugin classpath, for example so I can use a Scala 2.12 "
"app."
msgstr ""
"プラグインのクラスパスを隔離したい。例えば、Scala 2.12 アプリケーションを使いたい場合など。"

#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:14
msgid "Steps"
msgstr "手順"

#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:17
msgid ""
"Start with a command-line application published to Maven Central, for "
"example Coursier CLI, or your own application."
msgstr ""
"Maven Central にコマンドライン・アプリ (例えば Coursier CLI) か、"
"独自のアプリケーションが公開されていることを前提とする。"

#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:18
msgid "Define a synthetic subproject that wraps the command-line app:"
msgstr "コマンドライン・アプリを呼び出す合成サブプロジェクトを定義する:"

#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:30
msgid "\"2.12.21\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:31
msgid "\"io.get-coursier\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:31
msgid "\"coursier-cli\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:31
msgid "\"2.1.14\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:32
msgid "\"coursier.cli.Coursier\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:33
msgid "// applicable to sbt 2.x only"
msgstr "// sbt 2.x のみに適用される"

#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:42
msgid ""
"Define a setting that represents the command-line argument and a dynamic "
"task that calls `run` task on the synthetic subproject."
msgstr ""
"コマンドライン引数を表すセッティングと、合成サブプロジェクトの `run` タスクを呼び出す動的タスクを定義する。"

#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:44
msgid ""
"````admonish example title=\"project/BootstrapPlugin.scala\"\n"
"```scala\n"
"package example\n"
"\n"
"import sbt.{ *, given }\n"
"import Keys.*\n"
"\n"
"object BootstrapPlugin extends AutoPlugin:\n"
"  override lazy val requires = sbt.plugins.JvmPlugin\n"
"\n"
"  object autoImport:\n"
"    val packageBootstrap = taskKey[HashedVirtualFileRef]"
"(\"packageBootstrap\")\n"
"    val packageBootstrapArgs = settingKey[Seq[String]]"
"(\"packageBootstrapArgs\")\n"
"    val packageBootstrapOutput = settingKey[File]"
"(\"packageBootstrapOutput\")\n"
"  end autoImport\n"
"  import autoImport.*\n"
"\n"
"  lazy val bootstrapCs = project\n"
"    .settings(\n"
"      scalaVersion := \"2.12.21\",\n"
"      libraryDependencies += \"io.get-coursier\" %% \"coursier-cli\" % "
"\"2.1.14\",\n"
"      Compile / run / mainClass := Some(\"coursier.cli.Coursier\"),\n"
"      // applicable to sbt 2.x only\n"
"      clientSide := false,\n"
"    )\n"
"\n"
"  override lazy val extraProjects = Vector(bootstrapCs)\n"
"\n"
"  override lazy val projectSettings = Vector(\n"
"    packageBootstrapOutput := target.value / \"bootstrap\" / s\"$"
"{moduleName.value}.jar\",\n"
"    packageBootstrapArgs := {\n"
"      val coord =\n"
"        s\"${organization.value}:${name.value}_${scalaBinaryVersion.value}:$"
"{version.value}\"\n"
"      val sv = scalaVersion.value\n"
"      Vector(\"bootstrap\", \"--verbose\", \"--bat=true\",\n"
"        \"--scala-version\", sv,\n"
"        \"-f\", coord,\n"
"        \"-o\", packageBootstrapOutput.value.toString)\n"
"    },\n"
"    packageBootstrap := Def.uncached {\n"
"      // to process args before toTask, we need to use dynamic tasks\n"
"      (Def.taskDyn {\n"
"        // phase 1\n"
"        val c = fileConverter.value\n"
"        val args = packageBootstrapArgs.value\n"
"        val out = packageBootstrapOutput.value\n"
"        // phase 2\n"
"        val outVf: HashedVirtualFileRef = c.toVirtualFile(out.toPath())\n"
"        IO.createDirectory(out.getParentFile())\n"
"        // phase 3\n"
"        (bootstrapCs / Compile / run)\n"
"          .toTask(args.mkString(\" \", \" \", \"\"))\n"
"          .map(_ => outVf)\n"
"      }).value\n"
"    },\n"
"  )\n"
"end BootstrapPlugin\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/recipes/plugin-isolation.md:104
msgid ""
"````admonish note\n"
"If the command-line app calls `sys.exit(1)`, you have to fork the `run`:\n"
"\n"
"```scala\n"
"// default for sbtn\n"
"clientSide := true,\n"
"// for sbt --server\n"
"Compile / run / fork := true,\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""
"````admonish note\n"
"コマンドライン・アプリが `sys.exit(1)` を呼び出す場合、`run` をフォークする必要がある:\n"
"\n"
"```scala\n"
"// sbtn のデフォルト値\n"
"clientSide := true,\n"
"// sbt --server の場合\n"
"Compile / run / fork := true,\n"
"```\n"
"````"

